{"D:\\wt\\hanksnail\\vlog\\hanksnail\\voz\\b000_t1.wav": {"text": "Florida spent 10 years picking up giant snails by hand, 168,000 of them. They threw a party, they said it was over. And less than a year later, a gardener up in Pasco County looked down in the yard and found one sitting right there. Then another, then about a thousand more. Y'all, I drove over here to see this with my own eyes. Because this is the second time Florida has beaten this snail. And it is the third time the snail came back. I'm Hank. I'm 62. I live out back of a bayou in Louisiana, and I am not a scientist. I'm just a fellow with a pickup truck and too many questions. When the state does something strange with an animal, I go find out what happened. And this one, buddy, this one is strange. So let me show you what we're dealing with. This is a giant African land snail. Not the little garden snail you step on by accident.", "words": [{"w": " Florida", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.3}, {"w": " spent", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.64}, {"w": " 10", "s": 0.64, "e": 0.9}, {"w": " years", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.22}, {"w": " picking", "s": 1.22, "e": 1.54}, {"w": " up", "s": 1.54, "e": 1.76}, {"w": " giant", "s": 1.76, "e": 2.12}, {"w": " snails", "s": 2.12, "e": 2.5}, {"w": " by", "s": 2.5, "e": 2.78}, {"w": " hand,", "s": 2.78, "e": 3.84}, {"w": " 168,000", "s": 3.84, "e": 4.96}, {"w": " of", "s": 4.96, "e": 5.28}, {"w": " them.", "s": 5.28, "e": 5.92}, {"w": " They", "s": 6.02, "e": 6.16}, {"w": " threw", "s": 6.16, "e": 6.36}, {"w": " a", "s": 6.36, "e": 6.5}, {"w": " party,", "s": 6.5, "e": 7.02}, {"w": " they", "s": 7.02, "e": 7.18}, {"w": " said", "s": 7.18, "e": 7.36}, {"w": " it", "s": 7.36, "e": 7.46}, {"w": " was", "s": 7.46, "e": 7.6}, {"w": " over.", "s": 7.6, "e": 8.38}, {"w": " And", "s": 8.38, "e": 8.6}, {"w": " less", "s": 8.6, "e": 8.7}, {"w": " than", "s": 8.7, "e": 8.88}, {"w": " a", "s": 8.88, "e": 9.0}, {"w": " year", "s": 9.0, "e": 9.16}, {"w": " later,", "s": 9.16, "e": 9.8}, {"w": " a", "s": 9.8, "e": 